	;	TIMES SOURCE:TARGET:쾌Ｖ, 1.40
	;	TIMES SOURCE:TARGET:정애 , 1.15
	;	TIMES SOURCE:TARGET:아픔 , 0.70
	;	TIMES SOURCE:TARGET:반감 , 0.70
